:0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Note that `<projectFiles>` have only `src`, from [psalm.xml](https://github.com/sanmai/infection/blob/psalm/psalm.xml#L8):\r\n```xml\r\n    <projectFiles>\r\n        <directory name=\"src\" />\r\n    </projectFiles>\r\n```\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce:\r\n```\r\ngit clone https://github.com/sanmai/infection.git -b psalm\r\ncd infection\r\ncomposer install\r\nphp vendor/bin/psalm --version\r\nphp vendor/bin/psalm --show-info=false\r\n```\r\n\r\nObserve:\r\n```\r\nPsalm dev-master@ad3e4499821310df068766d3957677f304a0a353\r\nScanning files...\r\nAnalyzing files...\r\n\r\nERROR: UndefinedMethod - vendor/symfony/console/Command/Command.php:416:16 - Method Infection\\Command\\InfectionCommand::validatename does not exist\r\n        $this->validateName($name);\r\n\r\n\r\nERROR: UndefinedMethod - vendor/symfony/console/Command/Command.php:416:16 - Method Infection\\Command\\ConfigureCommand::validatename does not exist\r\n        $this->validateName($name);\r\n\r\n\r\n------------------------------\r\n2 errors found\r\n------------------------------\r\n```\r\n\r\n[validatename is a private method there](https://github.com/symfony/console/blob/master/Command/Command.php#L640), it can't be called from  ConfigureCommand. It has nothing to do with ConfigureCommand.","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":